A posting date earlier than its transaction date produces a warning.

========== API ==========

accounts()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-05 Earlier posting
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK ; [2024-01-04]
  Equity:Opening  -1 SEK

========== WARNINGS ==========

[POSTING_DATE_BEFORE_TRANSACTION] Posting date 2024-01-04 must not precede transaction date 2024-01-05
